Students in at least one circle:
$\begin{aligned}&\mathrel{\phantom{=}}40-5\\&=35\end{aligned}$
Let $x$ be the number in both. The three inside regions add to $35$:
$\begin{aligned}(25-x)+x+(22-x)&=35\\47-x&=35\\x&=12\end{aligned}$
Geography only:
$\begin{aligned}&\mathrel{\phantom{=}}25-12\\&=13\end{aligned}$
Hockey only:
$\begin{aligned}&\mathrel{\phantom{=}}22-12\\&=10\end{aligned}$

