Place $10$ in the overlap and $6$ outside both circles.
German only:
$\begin{aligned}&\mathrel{\phantom{=}}24-10\\&=14\end{aligned}$
Tennis only is the remaining region:
$\begin{aligned}&\mathrel{\phantom{=}}42-(14+10+6)\\&=12\end{aligned}$
Tennis altogether:
$\begin{aligned}&\mathrel{\phantom{=}}12+10\\&=22\end{aligned}$

